    "Tags help you group and search photos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les étiquettes vous aident à regrouper et rechercher vos photos."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tags helfen dir, Fotos zu gruppieren und zu suchen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las etiquetas te ayudan a agrupar y buscar fotos."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le etichette aiutano a raggruppare e cercare le foto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the heart on a photo to keep it here.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez le cœur d'une photo pour la garder ici."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tippe auf das Herz eines Fotos, um es hier zu behalten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toca el corazón de una foto para guardarla aquí."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tocca il cuore su una foto per tenerla qui."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The certificate of %@ cannot be verified. Trust it anyway?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Zertifikat von %@ kann nicht verifiziert werden. Trotzdem vertrauen?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se puede verificar el certificado de %@. ¿Confiar de todos modos?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il certificato di %@ non può essere verificato. Fidarsi comunque?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le certificat de %@ ne peut pas être vérifié. Lui faire confiance quand même ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cover is what your timeline shows for this stack.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Titelbild zeigt deine Zeitleiste für diesen Stapel an."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La portada es lo que tu cronología muestra para esta pila."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La copertina è ciò che la cronologia mostra per questo gruppo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La couverture est ce que votre timeline affiche pour cette pile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded file was empty.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier téléchargé était vide."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die heruntergeladene Datei war leer."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El archivo descargado estaba vacío."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il file scaricato era vuoto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next backup will re-check every photo against the server. Nothing is deleted — already-uploaded photos are simply skipped again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das nächste Backup prüft jedes Foto erneut gegen den Server. Nichts wird gelöscht — bereits hochgeladene Fotos werden einfach erneut übersprungen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La próxima copia de seguridad volverá a comprobar cada foto con el servidor. No se elimina nada: las fotos ya subidas simplemente se omiten de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il prossimo backup ricontrollerà ogni foto sul server. Nulla viene eliminato — le foto già caricate vengono semplicemente saltate di nuovo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La prochaine sauvegarde vérifiera chaque photo auprès du serveur. Rien n'est supprimé — les photos déjà envoyées sont simplement ignorées à nouveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photo stays in your library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La photo reste dans votre photothèque."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Foto bleibt in deiner Mediathek."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La foto permanece en tu biblioteca."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La foto resta nella tua libreria."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photos stay in your library — only this memory is removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Fotos bleiben in deiner Mediathek — nur diese Erinnerung wird entfernt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las fotos permanecen en tu biblioteca: solo se elimina este recuerdo."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le foto restano nella tua libreria — viene rimosso solo questo ricordo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les photos restent dans votre photothèque — seul ce souvenir est supprimé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photos you kept.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les photos que vous avez gardées."
